# No life was lost this turn, so Thought-Stalker Warlock's enters trigger takes the "otherwise" branch: Bot2 discards a card of
# its own choice (CR 701.9b) - a Forest, not the Lightning Bolt Bot1 would have taken - and its hand is not revealed to a choice
# of Bot1's (`! Bot1.Choose`, the choice of a card from a revealed hand, is never asked of Bot1). Positive control for the
# lost-life branch is the sibling scenario.

